msgid "1. 自动战斗依赖按键识别，请在游戏设置中打开快捷键显示，提升出牌准确率。\n2. 国际服玩家请将本模式配置中的\"游戏语言\"设置为繁体中文。"
msgstr "1. Auto battle relies on shortcut recognition. Enable shortcut display in the game settings for better accuracy.\n2. International server players should set Game Language to Traditional Chinese in this mode."

